        "created_at": "2026-06-10T17:42:35.214Z",
        "cooked": "<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7b01c8b49a03e88926e2fc7afc0e6d0bc025bc2d.gif\" alt=\"Dr Who What GIFs | Tenor\" data-base62-sha1=\"hyayalMw1uomS8cVs2TYdOKMo1L\" width=\"220\" height=\"168\" class=\"animated\"></p>\n<p>Given this is such a blatant take on the GL/GA cover, I assume it’s just something Adam did for fun / a commission, and isn’t canon? (That, and I don’t know if what world <em>Captain Cosmic</em> of all people would be delivering this news.)</p>",
